  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/VinnyStalck/knowlogy/-/raw/exposure/main/assets/images/exposure-category.png\" alt=\"曝光分类\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexposure-knowlogy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/onbX6Nsj?style=flat&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;label=下载量&amp;labelColor=03190a&amp;color=1e1e1e\" alt=\"Modrinth下载量\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure-knowlogy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1230608?style=flat&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;label=下载量&amp;labelColor=241009&amp;color=1e1e1e\" alt=\"CurseForge下载量\"></a></p><p>这是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knowlogy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Knowlogy</a>的扩展模组，它将<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Exposure</a>模组说明整合到<strong>知识之书</strong>中，展示来自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmoddedmc.wiki%252fen%252fproject%252fexposure%252fdocs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Exposure官方Wiki</a>的信息。</p><h2>功能特点</h2><h3>合成配方</h3><p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/VinnyStalck/knowlogy/-/raw/exposure/main/assets/images/film-entry.png\" alt=\"胶片条目\"></p><p>显示每个物品和方块的合成配方，并提供相关条目链接。</p><h3>使用指南</h3><p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/VinnyStalck/knowlogy/-/raw/exposure/main/assets/images/camera-controls-page.png\" alt=\"相机控制页面\"></p><p>包含图片和动态键位说明，助您更好地理解操作方式。</p><h3>深度解析</h3><p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/VinnyStalck/knowlogy/-/raw/exposure/main/assets/images/chromatic-process-page.png\" alt=\"色彩处理页面\"></p><p>详细讲解游戏机制原理。</p><h3>扩展支持</h3><p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/VinnyStalck/knowlogy/-/raw/exposure/main/assets/images/instant-camera-entry.png\" alt=\"拍立得条目\"></p><p>包含对<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexposure-polaroid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Exposure: Polaroid</a>模组的支持条目。</p>",
